--- intent
List the names of people whose city is not recorded.

--- edition2
query homeless() {
  match { $p: Person  $p.city is null }
  return { $p.name }
}

--- edition3
query homeless() {
  match { $p: Person  $p.city is null }
  return { $p.name }
}

--- expect unordered
